Date: Sat, 23 May 2026 19:46:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: collection search, streak counter, push opt-in, share
 collection, daily cron
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Collection search:
- Search bar on collection page filters by name, series, rarity, color in real-time
- searchCol(query) in collection.js, wired to oninput on #col-search
- State preserved in state.searchQuery across sort/filter changes

Scan streak:
- updateStreak() tracks consecutive daily scan days in localStorage
- 🔥 N day streak pill appears in header after 2+ consecutive days
- Called on every scan (incScans) and on app init
- Resets automatically if a day is missed

Push notifications opt-in:
- Green 'Enable Deal Alerts' card appears on alerts page when:
  user has alerts set AND push not already subscribed
- One-tap setup — calls setupPushNotifications() which already handles
  permission request + SW subscription + API storage
- Hides itself after successful subscription

Share collection:
- 'Share Collection' button next to Export Certificate in val-card
- Generates a stats summary: car count, total value, STH/TH/rare counts
- Uses navigator.share() on mobile (native sheet), clipboard on desktop

Landing page:
- Replace '0 Competitors' stat (credibility killer) with '<10s Avg Scan Speed'

Daily reminder cron:
- api/push-daily-reminder.js: Vercel Edge Function, rotates 4 messages
  by day of week to avoid notification fatigue
- vercel.json: cron at 30 12 * * * (6:00 PM IST daily)
- Only fires to opted-in push subscribers, non-blocking Promise.allSettled
